n{aligned}\\frac{9}{-3+2\\text{i}} & =\\frac{9}{-3+2\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{-3-2\\text{i}}{-3-2\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-27-18\\text{i}}{9+6\\text{i}-6\\text{i}-4{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-27-18\\text{i}}{9-4(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{-27-18\\text{i}}{9+4} \\\\  & =\\frac{-27-18\\text{i}}{13}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-27-18\\text{i}}{13}=-\\frac{27}{13}-\\frac{18}{13}\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-74648/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "678ba6cb-b259-5a25-858c-9db161a34ca9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74648"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-962/selection/210660cc9a01f9fac6c5a9728a894fa12a841d98470f45dc246f6eeb18ed2796" :answer/id #uuid "957eb747-c786-5ed5-81c6-9a7d97b49d39" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-962/selection/5ecf0b34ab9839e65e5c119832fdec2233e0603c38e7eb058cb4377118177828" :answer/id #uuid "383ddaa4-1324-50dc-80df-87b3797aaabf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}+\\frac{1}{4}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-962/selection/82302affe59a4f95b085dca0bd3325840771d9b86db3851d126d4296d454f332" :answer/id #uuid "36b6a57f-5bf8-531f-8f53-aad77bd337dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{4}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-962/selection/72bd3e568dda37f68ad71f88bbebc401b50f6c7a6f78c1c7bf7f2ae9dbe0aa2d" :answer/id #uuid "c75f51c1-ee9a-5c57-97cd-fbf43cef63d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-962/selection/e5fdad3256a6979dfcf97f46f5b8c6ae74371f9e0d9db234e2541ac9278eee63" :answer/id #uuid "37352a9b-5a04-5720-a017-28037f8a75a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{4}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-962/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "55b6a45f-2eab-57dd-ad5e-70e2ef9d6fe6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-962/selection/210660cc9a01f9fac6c5a9728a894fa12a841d98470f45dc246f6eeb18ed2796" :answer-field/choices ["q-962/selection/210660cc9a01f9fac6c5a9728a894fa12a841d98470f45dc246f6eeb18ed2796" "q-962/selection/5ecf0b34ab9839e65e5c119832fdec2233e0603c38e7eb058cb4377118177828" "q-962/selection/82302affe59a4f95b085dca0bd3325840771d9b86db3851d126d4296d454f332" "q-962/selection/72bd3e568dda37f68ad71f88bbebc401b50f6c7a6f78c1c7bf7f2ae9dbe0aa2d" "q-962/selection/e5fdad3256a6979dfcf97f46f5b8c6ae74371f9e0d9db234e2541ac9278eee63"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-962" :question/id #uuid "d7d5daa6-e06b-50a9-a8f7-655d6e8baf26" :question/math-academy-id "q-962" :question/problem "$\\frac{5}{6+2\\text{i}}=$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator is $6+2\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $6-2\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $6-2\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5}{6+2\\text{i}} & =\\frac{5}{6+2\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{6-2\\text{i}}{6-2\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{30-10\\text{i}}{36-12\\text{i}+12\\text{i}-4{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{30-10\\text{i}}{36-4{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{30-10\\text{i}}{36-4(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{30-10\\text{i}}{36+4} \\\\  & =\\frac{30-10\\text{i}}{40}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{30-10\\text{i}}{40}=\\frac{30}{40}-\\frac{10}{40}\\text{i}=\\frac{3}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-962/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "678ba6cb-b259-5a25-858c-9db161a34ca9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-962"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316887/field-1/a272cbe64fea514fe5c8c9685aef2c9378fdfe44c54941c8bcba64a5f713bc84" :answer/id #uuid "7cb402d8-5cef-5c13-af7d-a60cd743f2d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316887/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "f924ba43-9f57-5d41-80d0-ee5851ea78fa" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316887/field-1/a272cbe64fea514fe5c8c9685aef2c9378fdfe44c54941c8bcba64a5f713bc84" :answer-field/choices ["q-316887/field-1/a272cbe64fea514fe5c8c9685aef2c9378fdfe44c54941c8bcba64a5f713bc84"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316887/field-2/fea7f6b22e69e29a9716f674d580a63eca4b26e1b4ae5c4f38b3026c28b2b97d" :answer/id #uuid "971980d3-5327-544b-a860-bdb8142b4fe4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316887/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "30ee273e-74c6-55b3-9903-941db30a291d" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316887/field-2/fea7f6b22e69e29a9716f674d580a63eca4b26e1b4ae5c4f38b3026c28b2b97d" :answer-field/choices ["q-316887/field-2/fea7f6b22e69e29a9716f674d580a63eca4b26e1b4ae5c4f38b3026c28b2b97d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316887" :question/id #uuid "316b450f-4d16-5f0f-a3da-b6e3a2ee9dde" :question/math-academy-id "q-316887" :question/problem "Evaluate the expression below, expressing your answer in the form $a+b\\text{i},$ where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers.\n\n$\\frac{-9+7\\text{i}}{8\\text{i}}=($\n {{field-1}} \n$)\\,+\\,($\n{{field-2}}\n$)\\,\\text{i}$" :question/worked-solution "Here, the denominator is the imaginary number $8\\text{i}.$ Note that this can be written as $0+8\\text{i},$ so the conjugate is $0-8\\text{i},$ or simply $-8\\text{i}.$\n\nSo, we multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $-8\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-9+7\\text{i}}{8\\text{i}} & =\\frac{-9+7\\text{i}}{8\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{-8\\text{i}}{-8\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{72\\text{i}-56{\\text{i}}^{2}}{-64{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{72\\text{i}-56(-1)}{-64(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{56+72\\text{i}}{64}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{56+72\\text{i}}{64} & =\\frac{56}{64}+\\frac{72}{64}\\text{i} \\\\  & =(\\frac{7}{8})+(\\frac{9}{8})\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316887/field-1" "q-316887/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "730fc9a7-a1b8-55a4-b8d3-666f87b82958"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316887"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-316883/field-1/3de79bddf6f841c5881cdae443d3aaa683eb5842e99646c5b7e2837e89382703" :answer/id #uuid "b3739184-204b-5bf6-b778-a2d5a444aeea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316883/field-1/21bc1f5ac2b6db8ca11973d9b85c1eeb6af2cd920b556e0cf3d98ab9a728286a" :answer/id #uuid "b5f64e38-476b-5f65-a7ab-97688bdce75a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316883/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "a6aa6ee7-e372-51d5-8ba2-ae0d45a38ced" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316883/field-1/3de79bddf6f841c5881cdae443d3aaa683eb5842e99646c5b7e2837e89382703" :answer-field/choices ["q-316883/field-1/3de79bddf6f841c5881cdae443d3aaa683eb5842e99646c5b7e2837e89382703" "q-316883/field-1/21bc1f5ac2b6db8ca11973d9b85c1eeb6af2cd920b556e0cf3