estion/answer-fields ["q-316883/field-1" "q-316883/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "730fc9a7-a1b8-55a4-b8d3-666f87b82958"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316883"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74659/selection/1d26d0eb30a0c1787d7e5618698413991b2c7eb2cc28624d2aaa40af626015ab" :answer/id #uuid "15b6bed4-902c-5c4e-becf-c810855b2013" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}+\\frac{1}{8}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74659/selection/1b92c2b849b8710ead7cc30b6e66259ccb07713acf4eac537a1f2b76a352f417" :answer/id #uuid "d3ae78aa-a8ba-5371-9a04-15acfd48b66f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{2}-\\frac{3}{8}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74659/selection/b8acff074b1f3c5ac06eaacc8ccbd52be562b7f231f893bdc84cd3dae7155bdb" :answer/id #uuid "f147c615-f613-5bfb-ac8f-6df935875467" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{5}{8}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74659/selection/786be378610e7f2e62e7d82b80a35de43178c5e25383518e40ccde3194a395d6" :answer/id #uuid "b3423c26-80ab-5b46-b4b5-59bfd96f259c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}-\\frac{1}{8}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74659/selection/b223872c9bbcd072dc38cb1e10166e5f940daf28a7bfb5754ece2fef53aa0703" :answer/id #uuid "c4eabb36-f6b3-577e-9d33-49b95f12f027" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{2}-\\frac{1}{8}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74659/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e48681cf-2d37-5061-9ef2-e8325e724d7d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-74659/selection/786be378610e7f2e62e7d82b80a35de43178c5e25383518e40ccde3194a395d6" :answer-field/choices ["q-74659/selection/1d26d0eb30a0c1787d7e5618698413991b2c7eb2cc28624d2aaa40af626015ab" "q-74659/selection/1b92c2b849b8710ead7cc30b6e66259ccb07713acf4eac537a1f2b76a352f417" "q-74659/selection/b8acff074b1f3c5ac06eaacc8ccbd52be562b7f231f893bdc84cd3dae7155bdb" "q-74659/selection/786be378610e7f2e62e7d82b80a35de43178c5e25383518e40ccde3194a395d6" "q-74659/selection/b223872c9bbcd072dc38cb1e10166e5f940daf28a7bfb5754ece2fef53aa0703"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-74659" :question/id #uuid "6b1df748-6885-5736-937a-15d2623e818b" :question/math-academy-id "q-74659" :question/problem "If ${z}_{1}=1-12\\text{i}$ and ${z}_{2}=8\\text{i}$, then ${z}_{1}$ divided by ${z}_{2}$ equals" :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1-12\\text{i}}{8\\text{i}}\n$$\n\nThe denominator is the imaginary number $8\\text{i}.$ Note that this can be written as $0+8\\text{i},$ so the conjugate is $0-8\\text{i},$ or simply $-8\\text{i}.$\n\nSo, we multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $-8\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{z}_{1}}{{z}_{2}} & =\\frac{1-12\\text{i}}{8\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-12\\text{i}}{8\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{-8\\text{i}}{-8\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8\\text{i}+96{\\text{i}}^{2}}{-64{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8\\text{i}+96(-1)}{-64(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{-96-8\\text{i}}{64}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-96-8\\text{i}}{64}=-\\frac{96}{64}-\\frac{8}{64}\\text{i}=-\\frac{3}{2}-\\frac{1}{8}\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-74659/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "730fc9a7-a1b8-55a4-b8d3-666f87b82958"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74659"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-167677/selection/5afef26d4d03b456349a179dfba64eee8b5ce092b31278daaadf086092197194" :answer/id #uuid "3dd4c821-cdf8-5a5a-a21